{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1f0m_nyksetzr.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1vd1qadx52uao.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3b8en2pv9-gb8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae | Brightluxx</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"LED Display Pricing Guide UAE (2026): Cost Per Sqm by Type\", \"description\": \"What LED screens actually cost in the UAE in 2026 \\u2014 outdoor, indoor, rental and transparent LED price ranges per square metre, plus what drives your final quote.\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/hero_dubai.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"datePublished\": \"2026-08-19\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-08-19\", \"articleSection\": \"LED Display Technology\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How much does an LED screen cost in Dubai?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Outdoor LED screens run roughly AED 3,900\\u20139,500 per m\\u00b2 and indoor fine-pitch from AED 7,500 per m\\u00b2 in 2026, depending on pixel pitch, structure and control system. Request a same-day itemised quote for exact pricing.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How much does a 3x3 LED video wall cost in the UAE?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A typical 3\\u00d73-equivalent LED video wall (~7.8m\\u00b2) at P1.8\\u2013P2.5 costs AED 60,000\\u2013110,000 installed; premium sub-1.2mm COB versions can exceed AED 150,000.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the LED wall price per square foot?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Roughly AED 360\\u2013880 per sq ft for outdoor screens and from AED 700 per sq ft for indoor fine-pitch, converted from per-m\\u00b2 pricing.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"LED Display Pricing Guide UAE (2026): Cost Per Sqm by Type\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>LED Display Pricing Guide UAE (2026): Cost Per Sqm by Type</h1><p>Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>What LED screens actually cost in the UAE in 2026 — outdoor, indoor, rental and transparent LED price ranges per square metre, plus what drives your final quote.</p><div><h2>LED screen price in Dubai &amp; UAE: quick answer</h2><p>As a working budget for 2026: <strong>outdoor LED screens cost roughly AED 3,900–9,500 per m²</strong>, <strong>indoor fine-pitch LED starts around AED 7,500 per m²</strong> and rises with finer pixel pitch, <strong>rental-spec panels run AED 2,500–5,500 per m²</strong> to purchase, and <strong>transparent LED typically lands between AED 6,000–12,000 per m²</strong>. Final pricing always depends on size, pixel pitch, structure, access and control system — treat these as planning ranges, not quotations.</p><h2>LED video wall cost per square meter, by type</h2><ul><li><strong>Outdoor advertising screens (P4–P10):</strong> AED 3,900–9,500/m² supplied and installed, plus structure and DEWA power works.</li><li><strong>Indoor video walls (P1.2–P2.5):</strong> from AED 7,500/m²; sub-1.5mm COB and MicroLED command a premium for close-viewing quality.</li><li><strong>Rental / staging panels:</strong> AED 2,500–5,500/m² to buy, or daily hire from AED 150–400/m² depending on duration.</li><li><strong>Transparent / mesh LED:</strong> AED 6,000–12,000/m² depending on transparency ratio and glass integration.</li></ul><h2>LED wall price per square foot</h2><p>If you budget in square feet: divide the per-m² figures by 10.76. Outdoor works out to roughly <strong>AED 360–880 per sq ft</strong>, and indoor fine-pitch from about <strong>AED 700 per sq ft</strong> upward.</p><h2>How much does a 3x3 video wall cost?</h2><p>A classic 3×3 LED video wall of 55\" equivalent area (~3.7m × 2.1m ≈ 7.8m²) at P1.8–P2.5 typically lands between <strong>AED 60,000 and AED 110,000</strong> installed, including processing and mounting. The same canvas in premium sub-1.2mm COB can reach AED 150,000+. LCD 3×3 videowalls are cheaper upfront (AED 35,000–60,000) but carry visible bezels and shorter lifespan.</p><h2>How much does LED signage cost?</h2><p>Smaller formats: LED poster totems from AED 8,000–18,000 each; storefront window displays AED 12,000–35,000; illuminated channel-letter signage from AED 350–900 per letter depending on size and lighting type.</p><h2>What moves your price up or down</h2><ul><li><strong>Pixel pitch</strong> — halving the pitch roughly quadruples the LED count.</li><li><strong>Structure &amp; access</strong> — facade steelwork, cranage and night works add 10–30%.</li><li><strong>Brightness &amp; IP rating</strong> — outdoor 5,000+ nit, IP65 panels cost more than indoor equivalents.</li><li><strong>Control &amp; redundancy</strong> — broadcast or control-room processing adds cost but protects uptime.</li><li><strong>Warranty &amp; spares</strong> — proper 5-year cover with local spare stock is worth pricing in.</li></ul><p>Estimate your own project with our <a href=\"/calculator\">LED cost calculator</a> and <a href=\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\">wall size calculator</a>, read the detailed <a href=\"/contractors/led-cost-per-sqm\">LED cost per sqm guide</a>, or get a firm same-day quotation from our <a href=\"/dubai\">LED screen supplier team in Dubai</a>.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>How much does an LED screen cost in Dubai?</h3><p>Outdoor LED screens run roughly AED 3,900–9,500 per m² and indoor fine-pitch from AED 7,500 per m² in 2026, depending on pixel pitch, structure and control system. Request a same-day itemised quote for exact pricing.</p><h3>How much does a 3x3 LED video wall cost in the UAE?</h3><p>A typical 3×3-equivalent LED video wall (~7.8m²) at P1.8–P2.5 costs AED 60,000–110,000 installed; premium sub-1.2mm COB versions can exceed AED 150,000.</p><h3>What is the LED wall price per square foot?</h3><p>Roughly AED 360–880 per sq ft for outdoor screens and from AED 700 per sq ft for indoor fine-pitch, converted from per-m² pricing.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"blog\\\",\\\"led-display-pricing-guide-uae\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",nul