\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}],\\\"$Lf\\\"],\\\"$L10\\\"]}]\\nf:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n11:T1055,\\u003ch1\\u003eLED Display Pricing Guide UAE (2026): Cost Per Sqm by Type\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBlog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhat LED screens actually cost in the UAE in 2026 — outdoor, indoor, rental and transparent LED price ranges per square metre, plus what drives your final quote.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED screen price in Dubai \\u0026amp; UAE: quick answer\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAs a working budget for 2026: \\u003cstrong\\u003eoutdoor LED screens cost roughly AED 3,900–9,500 per m²\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eindoor fine-pitch LED starts around AED 7,500 per m²\\u003c/strong\\u003e and rises with finer pixel pitch, \\u003cstrong\\u003erental-spec panels run AED 2,500–5,500 per m²\\u003c/strong\\u003e to purchase, and \\u003cstrong\\u003etransparent LED typically lands between AED 6,000–12,000 per m²\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Final pricing always depends on size, pixel pitch, structure, access and control system — treat these as planning ranges, not quotations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED video wall cost per square meter, by type\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOutdoor advertising screens (P4–P10):\\u003c/strong\\u003e AED 3,900–9,500/m² supplied and installed, plus structure and DEWA power works.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eIndoor video walls (P1.2–P2.5):\\u003c/strong\\u003e from AED 7,500/m²; sub-1.5mm COB and MicroLED command a premium for close-viewing quality.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRental / staging panels:\\u003c/strong\\u003e AED 2,500–5,500/m² to buy, or daily hire from AED 150–400/m² depending on duration.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTransparent / mesh LED:\\u003c/strong\\u003e AED 6,000–12,000/m² depending on transparency ratio and glass integration.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED wall price per square foot\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIf you budget in square feet: divide the per-m² figures by 10.76. Outdoor works out to roughly \\u003cstrong\\u003eAED 360–880 per sq ft\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and indoor fine-pitch from about \\u003cstrong\\u003eAED 700 per sq ft\\u003c/strong\\u003e upward.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eHow much does a 3x3 video wall cost?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eA classic 3×3 LED video wall of 55\\\" equivalent area (~3.7m × 2.1m ≈ 7.8m²) at P1.8–P2.5 typically lands between \\u003cstrong\\u003eAED 60,000 and AED 110,000\\u003c/strong\\u003e installed, including processing and mounting. The same canvas in premium sub-1.2mm COB can reach AED 150,000+. LCD 3×3 videowalls are cheaper upfront (AED 35,000–60,000) but carry visible bezels and shorter lifespan.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eHow much does LED signage cost?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eSmaller formats: LED poster totems from AED 8,000–18,000 each; storefront window displays AED 12,000–35,000; illuminated channel-letter signage from AED 350–900 per letter depending on size and lighting type.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat moves your price up or down\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePixel pitch\\u003c/strong\\u003e — halving the pitch roughly quadruples the LED count.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eStructure \\u0026amp; access\\u003c/strong\\u003e — facade steelwork, cranage and night works add 10–30%.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBrightness \\u0026amp; IP rating\\u003c/strong\\u003e — outdoor 5,000+ nit, IP65 panels cost more than indoor equivalents.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eControl \\u0026amp; redundancy\\u003c/strong\\u003e — broadcast or control-room processing adds cost but protects uptime.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWarranty \\u0026amp; spares\\u003c/strong\\u003e — proper 5-year cover with local spare stock is worth pricing in.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEstimate your own project with our \\u003ca href=\\\"/calculator\\\"\\u003eLED cost calculator\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href=\\\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\\\"\\u003ewall size calculator\\u003c/a\\u003e, read the detailed \\u003ca href=\\\"/contractors/led-cost-per-sqm\\\"\\u003eLED cost per sqm guide\\u003c/a\\u003e, or get a firm same-day quotation from our \\u003ca href=\\\"/dubai\\\"\\u003eLED screen supplier team in Dubai\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow much does an LED screen cost in Dubai?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOutdoor LED screens run roughly AED 3,900–9,500 per m² and indoor fine-pitch from AED 7,500 per m² in 2026, depending on pixel pitch, structure and control system. Request a same-day itemised quote for exact pricing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow much does a 3x3 LED video wall cost in the UAE?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eA typical 3×3-equivalent LED video wall (~7.8m²) at P1.8–P2.5 costs AED 60,000–110,000 installed; premium sub-1.2mm COB versions can exceed AED 150,000.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the LED wall price per square foot?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRoughly AED 360–880 per sq ft for outdoor screens and from AED 700 per sq ft for indoor fine-pitch, converted from per-m² pricing.\\u003c/p\\u003e10:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$11\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"blog\",\"led-display-pricing-guide-uae\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\",\"c\",[\"products\"]],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4624],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The page