\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the LED wall price per square foot?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Roughly AED 360\\\\u2013880 per sq ft for outdoor screens and from AED 700 per sq ft for indoor fine-pitch, converted from per-m\\\\u00b2 pricing.\\\"}}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Blog\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Display Pricing Guide UAE (2026): Cost Per Sqm by Type\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}],\"$Lf\"],\"$L10\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n11:T1055,<h1>LED Display Pricing Guide UAE (2026): Cost Per Sqm by Type</h1><p>Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>What LED screens actually cost in the UAE in 2026 — outdoor, indoor, rental and transparent LED price ranges per square metre, plus what drives your final quote.</p><div><h2>LED screen price in Dubai &amp; UAE: quick answer</h2><p>As a working budget for 2026: <strong>outdoor LED screens cost roughly AED 3,900–9,500 per m²</strong>, <strong>indoor fine-pitch LED starts around AED 7,500 per m²</strong> and rises with finer pixel pitch, <strong>rental-spec panels run AED 2,500–5,500 per m²</strong> to purchase, and <strong>transparent LED typically lands between AED 6,000–12,000 per m²</strong>. Final pricing always depends on size, pixel pitch, structure, access and control system — treat these as planning ranges, not quotations.</p><h2>LED video wall cost per square meter, by type</h2><ul><li><strong>Outdoor advertising screens (P4–P10):</strong> AED 3,900–9,500/m² supplied and installed, plus structure and DEWA power works.</li><li><strong>Indoor video walls (P1.2–P2.5):</strong> from AED 7,500/m²; sub-1.5mm COB and MicroLED command a premium for close-viewing quality.</li><li><strong>Rental / staging panels:</strong> AED 2,500–5,500/m² to buy, or daily hire from AED 150–400/m² depending on duration.</li><li><strong>Transparent / mesh LED:</strong> AED 6,000–12,000/m² depending on transparency ratio and glass integration.</li></ul><h2>LED wall price per square foot</h2><p>If you budget in square feet: divide the per-m² figures by 10.76. Outdoor works out to roughly <strong>AED 360–880 per sq ft</strong>, and indoor fine-pitch from about <strong>AED 700 per sq ft</strong> upward.</p><h2>How much does a 3x3 video wall cost?</h2><p>A classic 3×3 LED video wall of 55\" equivalent area (~3.7m × 2.1m ≈ 7.8m²) at P1.8–P2.5 typically lands between <strong>AED 60,000 and AED 110,000</strong> installed, including processing and mounting. The same canvas in premium sub-1.2mm COB can reach AED 150,000+. LCD 3×3 videowalls are cheaper upfront (AED 35,000–60,000) but carry visible bezels and shorter lifespan.</p><h2>How much does LED signage cost?</h2><p>Smaller formats: LED poster totems from AED 8,000–18,000 each; storefront window displays AED 12,000–35,000; illuminated channel-letter signage from AED 350–900 per letter depending on size and lighting type.</p><h2>What moves your price up or down</h2><ul><li><strong>Pixel pitch</strong> — halving the pitch roughly quadruples the LED count.</li><li><strong>Structure &amp; access</strong> — facade steelwork, cranage and night works add 10–30%.</li><li><strong>Brightness &amp; IP rating</strong> — outdoor 5,000+ nit, IP65 panels cost more than indoor equivalents.</li><li><strong>Control &amp; redundancy</strong> — broadcast or control-room processing adds cost but protects uptime.</li><li><strong>Warranty &amp; spares</strong> — proper 5-year cover with local spare stock is worth pricing in.</li></ul><p>Estimate your own project with our <a href=\"/calculator\">LED cost calculator</a> and <a href=\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\">wall size calculator</a>, read the detailed <a href=\"/contractors/led-cost-per-sqm\">LED cost per sqm guide</a>, or get a firm same-day quotation from our <a href=\"/dubai\">LED screen supplier team in Dubai</a>.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>How much does an LED screen cost in Dubai?</h3><p>Outdoor LED screens run roughly AED 3,900–9,500 per m² and indoor fine-pitch from AED 7,500 per m² in 2026, depending on pixel pitch, structure and control system. Request a same-day itemised quote for exact pricing.</p><h3>How much does a 3x3 LED video wall cost in the UAE?</h3><p>A typical 3×3-equivalent LED video wall (~7.8m²) at P1.8–P2.5 costs AED 60,000–110,000 installed; premium sub-1.2mm COB versions can exceed AED 150,000.</p><h3>What is the LED wall price per square foot?</h3><p>Roughly AED 360–880 per sq ft for outdoor screens and from AED 700 per sq ft for indoor fine-pitch, converted from per-m² pricing.</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Blog — Led Display Pricing Guide Uae. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightlu